# Lab vectors — large ML artifacts. The v1 file ships in-repo (~27KB) so
# users can run --lab-augment out of the box; any other .pt build outputs
# are local artifacts. Add new files explicitly with `git add -f` only if
# you intend to ship them.
lab_vectors/*.pt
!lab_vectors/r1_distill_1.5b_v1.pt
